Package: texe
Version: @VERSION@
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: texe maintainers
Homepage: https://github.com/backmatter/texe
Description: Reproducible LaTeX environment for scientific writing
 texe creates and builds LaTeX papers with a checksummed, project-managed
 toolchain. The package includes texe, pqty, and pqty-fls and does not require
 a system TeX Live installation.
